  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "TerraLingua",
  "identifier": "10.57967/hf/8490",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tTerraLingua\n\t\n\n\nThis is a dataset generated by the TerraLingua multi-agent system to study the emergence of language, culture, and social structure among LLM-powered agents. Agents with personality traits compete for resources, communicate through persistent text artifacts, and form communities over thousands of timesteps. \nThe dataset includes raw simulation logs, full LLM reasoning traces, behavioral annotations generated by an AI-Anthropologist, and artifact linguistic complexity\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/GPaolo/TerraLingua.",
